PerfProbe interpretation for a future successful run:
The -perf flag starts a CADisplayLink on the main run loop. It logs one-second windows of UI FPS,
hitches, dropped-frame estimate, longest frame interval, current phase, and the five most frequent
instrumented view-body evaluations. Hitches exceed max(24 ms, expected interval * 1.6). Intervals
over 50 ms are individually logged. Use 8–12 settled one-second windows after loading, and report
the simulator/device plus configuration; simulator timings do not establish real-phone FPS.
